  "requirements": {
    "gpu": "NVIDIA GPU with compute capability >= 7.5 (Turing or newer). The ORT 1.31.1 CUDA 13 build ships SASS for sm_75/80/86/89/90/120 and PTX for sm_120 only; CUDA 13 itself dropped Maxwell, Pascal and Volta.",
